# Scratch worktrees for checking a ticket's branch: `git worktree add .wt-<ticket-id> ticket/<ticket-id>`
/.wt-[0-9]*/
# CEF_PATH scratch for test/build runs (a writable CEF copy when apps/desktop/.cef can't be used, e.g. in
# a sandbox): CEF_PATH=$PWD/.tmp-cef at the root, or a relative .tmp-cef under apps/desktop
.tmp-cef/
